  <ButtonText>k__BackingField: "Camil excuse toi et fais attention, et je suis sur
    que T\xE9a voudra bien te r\xE9parer."
  <NpcText>k__BackingField:
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 44ec2a6625f7a934dab5754819bfeb2e, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0358eca1d351f540a61dc689202b2b8, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Pardon T\xE9a, je ne voulais pas \xEAtre m\xE9chant avec toi.\r\n"
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d57cec67bb2a1a945ada3b66d3cb9bf5, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 15a032d1f64921b49a6cec6c0a26887d, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "\xC7a va, \xE7a va\u2026"
    - "Je veux bien te mettre un coup de cl\xE9 \xE0 molette, mais fais attention
      !"
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 44ec2a6625f7a934dab5754819bfeb2e, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 15a032d1f64921b49a6cec6c0a26887d, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - Oh merci !
